        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n62 Cosby Avenue, Portlaoise\nSpacious Own-Door Two-Bedroom Duplex Apartment with Private Entrance BER B\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, No. 62 Cosby Avenue is an exceptionally spacious two-bedroom own-door apartment extending to approximately 87 sq.m. (931 sq.ft.). While accessed via its own private entrance at ground-floor level, the accommodation itself is located on the first floor, providing added privacy and an elevated aspect. Benefiting from a B BER rating, two bathrooms, a south-facing orientation, allocated parking and a superbly proportioned layout, this impressive home is ideally suited to first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a quality property in a highly convenient location.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming private entrance hallway with useful under-stair storage and access to attic storage above. Upstairs, the bright and generously proportioned living room is flooded with natural light thanks to its desirable south-facing orientation and features an attractive electric fireplace, creating a warm and inviting focal point. The separate fully fitted kitchen offers excellent storage and worktop space, integrated appliances and views over the front of the property.\n\nThere are two spacious double bedrooms, both offering excellent proportions. The primary bedroom benefits from built-in wardrobes, new laminate flooring and a private ensuite shower room featuring a newly fitted shower unit. The second bedroom is equally spacious and is ideal as a guest room, home office or additional family accommodation. A large family bathroom, complete with a Jacuzzi bath, completes the accommodation.\n\nThe property has been further enhanced with a number of recent upgrades, including a new energy-efficient combi gas boiler installed in 2025, a water softener system and additional attic storage. These improvements contribute to the property's B BER rating, offering buyers the benefit of improved energy efficiency and modern comfort. A garden shed is also included in the sale, providing valuable external storage.\n\nExternally, the apartment enjoys the privacy of its own secure gated entrance, together with an allocated parking space and well-maintained communal grounds. The current management fee is 1,694.62.\n\nFeatures\nOwn-door apartment with private ground-floor entrance\nFirst-floor accommodation offering added privacy\nApprox. 87 sq.m. (931 sq.ft.)\nB BER rating\nSouth-facing orientation\nTwo spacious double bedrooms\nPrimary bedroom with new laminate flooring\nEnsuite shower room with newly fitted shower unit\nLarge family bathroom with Jacuzzi bath\nBright and spacious living room with feature electric fireplace\nSeparate fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\nNew energy-efficient combi gas boiler installed in 2025\nWater softener fitted\nAttic storage\nGarden shed included\nBuilt-in wardrobes\nGas-fired central heating\nPrivate gated entrance\nAllocated parking space\nManagement fee: 1,694.62\nPresented in excellent condition throughout\nIdeal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors\nExcellent location close to schools, shops, transport links and a wide range of local amenities\n\nCombining generous accommodation, a B BER rating, recent upgrades, modern comforts and a low-maintenance lifestyle, No. 62 Cosby Avenue is a superb home in one of Portlaoise's most convenient residential developments. With excellent amenities on the doorstep and easy access to the town centre, schools and transport links, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
